From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukas Rieger <lukas@0x53a.dev>
Date: Sat, 8 Mar 2026 12:00:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Add SpO2 (blood oxygen) sensor with hybris adaptor

Wire the LifeQ SpO2 vendor sensor (type 65561) through sensorfw.
The SpO2 algorithm runs on the SLPI (Hexagon DSP) via LifeQ's library;
this adaptor just reads the processed percentage from the HAL.

Includes verbose debug logging in processSample to discover the
vendor-specific sensors_event_t data layout.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate

Signed-off-by: Lukas Rieger <lukas@0x53a.dev>
---
